WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.680
Rover was a nice dog.

2
00:00:07.681 --> 00:00:12.502
But he chewed on shoes and socks.

3
00:00:12.503 --> 00:00:22.444
He dug up plants in the garden.

4
00:00:22.445 --> 00:00:32.499
Then one day Rover chased Mrs. Hart's kitten.

5
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:35.124
"No, Rover!" cried Emmy.

6
00:00:35.125 --> 00:00:43.786
"Leave Ginger alone!"

7
00:00:43.787 --> 00:00:47.977
"Rover is a good dog," Mrs. Hart said.

8
00:00:47.978 --> 00:00:54.910
"But he needs to learn some manners!"

9
00:00:54.911 --> 00:00:58.968
Dad and Emmy took Rover to school.

10
00:00:58.969 --> 00:01:03.417
There were lots of other dogs there.

11
00:01:03.418 --> 00:01:07.407
The dogs and people formed a circle.

12
00:01:07.408 --> 00:01:10.381
"Sit," said the teacher.

13
00:01:10.382 --> 00:01:18.922
All the dogs sat—except Rover.

14
00:01:18.923 --> 00:01:23.411
"Speak," said the teacher.

15
00:01:23.412 --> 00:01:29.355
All the dogs barked—except Rover.

16
00:01:29.356 --> 00:01:32.898
"Fetch," said the teacher.

17
00:01:32.899 --> 00:01:43.376
All the dogs fetched—except Rover.

18
00:01:43.377 --> 00:01:46.088
Dad and Emmy sighed.

19
00:01:46.089 --> 00:01:50.748
"Rover is a hopeless dog," said Emmy.

20
00:01:50.749 --> 00:01:54.551
"He's never going to learn anything."

21
00:01:54.552 --> 00:02:01.828
Dad and Emmy took Rover home.

22
00:02:01.829 --> 00:02:07.924
Mrs. Hart was outside.

23
00:02:07.925 --> 00:02:11.398
"She's looking for something," said Dad.

24
00:02:11.399 --> 00:02:14.158
"Ginger!" called Mrs. Hart.

25
00:02:14.159 --> 00:02:16.893
"Where are you?"

26
00:02:16.894 --> 00:02:19.969
"Oh no," said Emmy.

27
00:02:19.970 --> 00:02:29.971
"Mrs. Hart's kitten is lost!"

28
00:02:29.972 --> 00:02:33.426
Suddenly Rover sat.

29
00:02:33.427 --> 00:02:38.817
He barked three times.

30
00:02:38.818 --> 00:02:47.983
Then he raced into the backyard.

31
00:02:47.984 --> 00:02:55.589
Soon he came back—with Ginger!

32
00:02:55.590 --> 00:02:59.102
"Good dog, Rover!" said Emmy proudly.

33
00:02:59.103 --> 00:03:05.148
"You know how to sit, speak, and fetch."

34
00:03:05.149 --> 00:03:08.638
Rover wagged his tail.

35
00:03:08.639 --> 00:03:11.479
Then he ran to the garden

36
00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:18.178
"Oh no," Dad moaned.

